# Trucks & Fleet (SR-App)

Detailed reference: `docs/steering/domain/trucks-fleet.md`. Lightweight assignment only (ADR-005).

**MVP scope (all that's in):**
- **Truck**: label/name, identifier (plate/unit #), optional make/model/year, active flag, timestamps.
- **Assignment**: truck optionally assigned to a field agent (default vehicle) and/or a job — jobs/agents work without a truck.
- Inactive/out-of-service trucks excluded from assignment pickers.

**Explicitly REJECTED (do NOT build):**
- No telematics (engine/OBD/fuel/odometer/live vehicle GPS/maintenance automation).
- No live truck location (trucks aren't tracked; only agents emit coarse pings).
- No fake gauges/mileage/diagnostics.
- No hard deletes of referenced trucks — deactivate. Assignment is admin-gated + audited.

**Guidance:** nullable `truckId` FK on Job + optional default `truckId` on field-agent user; simple list + create/edit/deactivate.

**DoD:** trucks CRUD/deactivate; optionally assigned to agents+jobs via audited admin actions; inactive excluded; no telematics/fake-metric surface.
